Function:
  - (f)
  + (total-cost) :total-cost
Action:
  - move: ?a - loc ?b - loc
      pre: (and (at ?a) (conn ?a ?b))
      eff: (and (at ?b) (decrease (f) (g ?b)) (not (at ?a)))
  + move: ?a - loc ?b - loc
      pre: (and (at ?a) (conn ?a ?b))
      eff: (and (at ?b) (increase (total-cost) (- 0 (g ?b))) (not (at ?a)))
Init:
  - (= (f) 0)
  + (= (total-cost) 0)
Metric:
  - (f)
  + (total-cost)
Func prop:
  - (f): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff rhs_funcs:(g) write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff rhs_funcs:(g) write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
Global prop:
  - action_cost_func:(f)
  + action_cost_func:(total-cost)
